earn&nbsp;less. Specialists earn far more. Highest-paying skills include:&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Performance Marketing (PPC \/ Google Ads \/ Meta Ads)&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>SEO Strategy &amp; <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/technical-seo\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Technical SEO<\/a>&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Email Automation in B2B (HubSpot,&nbsp;Klaviyo, Mailchimp)&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Content Strategy &amp; Copywriting&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. The City You Work In&nbsp;<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Tier-1 cities pay the highest:<\/strong>&nbsp;Bangalore, Mumbai, Pune, Gurgaon, Hyderabad. Tier-2 cities offer good growth but slightly lower packages.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Type of Company&nbsp;<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Startups hire fast, pay moderately, offer&nbsp;growth. Agencies give maximum learning exposure. MNCs &amp; Unicorns offer&nbsp;highest&nbsp;salaries.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Certifications &amp; Skill Proof&nbsp;<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Companies prefer candidates trained in: <\/strong>Google Ads, Meta Ads, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-free-seo-tools\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO tools<\/a>, Analytics. Students trained with&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/digital-marketing-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogInterlink&amp;utm_campaign=seo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WsCube&nbsp;Tech&#8217;s digital marketing course<\/a> receive higher starting salaries because they have real project experience.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">AI &amp; Automation Skills That Are Pushing Digital Marketing Salaries Higher&nbsp;<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Digital marketing is no longer&nbsp;just about running&nbsp;ads and posting content. Companies are now hiring professionals who can work with AI tools,&nbsp;analyse&nbsp;data, and automat