nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>SEO is one of the highest-paying fields because it directly&nbsp;impacts&nbsp;business revenue. Therefore, understanding the&nbsp;fundamentals of SEO&nbsp;is&nbsp;must.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. PPC Specialist \/ Google Ads Expert Salary&nbsp;<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Understnding PPC&nbsp;in depth is important as these experts handle paid ads on Google, Meta, and other platforms. Salaries grow faster because this role drives sales.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Experience<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/td><td><strong>Salary Range<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Fresher PPC Executive&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u20b93 LPA \u2013 \u20b95 LPA&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>PPC Specialist (3\u20135 years)&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u20b97 LPA \u2013 \u20b915 LPA&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Performance Marketing Manager (5\u201310 years)&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u20b910 LPA \u2013 \u20b925 LPA&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Social Media Manager Salary&nbsp;<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Experience<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/td><td><strong>Salary<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Fresher&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u20b92\u20134 LPA&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>2\u20133 Years&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u20b94\u20137 LPA&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Manager Level&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u20b96\u201312 LPA&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-social-media-manager\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Become a social media manager<\/a>&nbsp;or get a brand-heavy role that&nbsp;pay&nbsp;higher: fashion, beauty, food, fitness, lifestyle.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Content Writer \/ Content Strategist Salary&nbsp;<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-l